31,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,Now we have to start narrowing it down. Any thoughts?,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,George,,I haven't noticed anything suspicious yet.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Yumi,,Um... I actually have some information. I think Takumi is the werewolf!,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Takumi,,"What?! That's a lie! Why are you blaming me, Yumi?","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"That was a very sudden revelation. Are you the Seer, Yumi?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Yumi, coming out as Seer on day one is a bold move. Is it a calculated risk?","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,George,,"It is quite a shock. Takumi, what do you have to say?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"Yes, I'm the Seer! I checked Takumi last night and he is the werewolf!","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Takumi,,I'm a villager! Yumi is lying to get me kicked out!,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"If Yumi is the Seer, the choice is simple. But if she's the wolf...","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"If Yumi is the wolf, she's trying to frame Takumi immediately. But usually, wolves are more subtle.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,George,,"I tend to trust Yumi's sincerity, but we must be careful.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Yumi,,Please believe me! I really saw it!,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Takumi,,Don't listen to her! She's just trying to trick you all!,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"@Yumi, your passion is convincing, but the werewolf can be deceptive too.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,I'll trust the Seer's claim for now. It's the most rational lead we have.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,George,,I agree. I will vote with the majority.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Yumi,,"Thank you! Please, we have to stop him!","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Takumi,,This is unfair! You're all making a mistake!,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,I will follow the consensus.,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
